mation','S-commit','S-recovery','S-readme'],derivation=d,applicability=app,unresolved=[],conflicts=[],alternatives=[])\nq=dict(disposition='ready_for_check',preferred_check='controlled_schedule',question='Can a recovery attempt for a known missing instance commit a command batch different from an earlier committed batch for the same row/instance, despite receiving a committed Prepare report, under the implementation\\\\'s static crash-fault membership and legal asynchronous dispatch?',importance='Two nonfailed replicas committing different command batches for the same consensus instance breaks decision agreement and can invalidate deterministic replicated execution. This is a distinct consequence proposition, not an expansion of either local reporting claim.',source_ids=ss,participants=['Original owner0','Fast supporters1,2','Recovering coordinator3','Other acceptor4'],objects=['InstanceSpace[row][instance].Cmds','Instance.Status','Recovery self/remote PrepareReply'],contexts=['N=5,F=2,Thrifty=true,Durable=false','One peer crash after the original decision','Delayed Commit dispatch coexists with later PreAccept dispatch','Actual executor emits a recovery request for a known hole'],event_paths=['Original fast decision -> peer crash -> next-instance PreAccept reveals missing prefix -> executor recovery request -> Prepare quorum -> renewed phase1/Accept -> later decision'],activity_classes=['A1','A2'],behavior_ids=['B-form','B-learn','B-select'],fact_ids=['F-decision'],supporting_behavior_ids={'B-propose':'Generates the original and later-instance proposals.','B-preaccept':'Provides qualified phase replies for initial and recovered proposals.','B-accept':'Replies to the renewed Accept, including established-decision guards.','B-authority':'Creates recovery attempt and self report at new ballot.','B-prepare':'Remote participant reports prior committed support.','B-wire':'Actual codec transports remote reports; known omission is retained.','B-config':'Supplies static N/F